{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C/G]As You [Am]have [G]promised, [Em]Lord, [Dm]today,
[G]You [Am]are [Em/B]letting Your [Am]servant go [G]away [Em]in [Dm]peace.
[F]May eyes [G7]have [Em]seen You [Dm]in [Em]broad daylight
[Am]before [G]all [Em]nations, planning [Am]salvation.
[Em/B]Light [Am]of [G]revelation [Em]for [Dm]the [Em]nations,
[Em]and glory of Your people [G]Israel.
{end_of_verse}
